  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: ssl.get_server_certificate() did not check that the\n     certificate matches the host name when ca_certs was given\n     (CVE-2026-19552)\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-19552.patch: pass the host as\n       server_hostname and enable check_hostname when ca_certs is given in\n       Lib/ssl.py, so a certificate for another host raises\n       ssl.CertificateError; add a regression test to Lib/test/test_ssl.py\n       and a note to Doc/library/ssl.rst\n     - CVE-2026-19552",
